   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FCA Tobaksprev globalt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3    St&#xf6;det till FCA syftar till att utveckla och st&#xe4;rka civial  samh&#xe4;llets roll globalt att st&#xf6;dja fattiga l&#xe4;ners f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att arbeta f&#xf6;r b&#xe4;ttre tobakskontroll, genom implementering av WHOs FCTC. FCA utvecklar och st&#xf6;djer n&#xe4;tverk av aktiva civila samh&#xe4;llet-akt&#xf6;rer p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3. The support to FCA aims at promoting and supporting global network for coordinated international campaigning agains tobacco, developing tobacco control capacity particularly in developing countries, and effectively carrying out a watchdog function in relation to the implementation of the WHO FCTC.</narrative>
  </description>
